 so the method should return false.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'n1', 'value': 'Double.NEGATIVE_INFINITY'}, {'parameter': 'n2', 'value': 'Double.NEGATIVE_INFINITY'}], 'expected': 'false', 'description': 'Both arguments are negative infinity; same reasoning as positive infinity, the method should return false.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'n1', 'value': 'Double.POSITIVE_INFINITY'}, {'parameter': 'n2', 'value': 'Double.NEGATIVE_INFINITY'}], 'expected': 'false', 'description': 'One argument is positive infinity and the other is negative infinity; the difference is infinite, so the method should return false.'}]}]
